# Development files, kept out of the package a merchant installs.
#
# Composer takes its dist from the repository archive, so anything not
# excluded here lands in every store's vendor directory. The fixtures matter
# most: they contain deliberately deprecated calls, which is the point of
# them, and which is exactly what a merchant's own security or deprecation
# scan would flag if they shipped.
/.github            export-ignore
/tools              export-ignore
/.gitattributes     export-ignore
